{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Will make.</b> On this mountain — that is Zion." "<b>A feast of fat things.</b> The meaning: He will feed them fatty foods." "<b>Marrowy.</b> From the same root as וּמוֹחַ עַצְמוֹתָיו יֵשֻׁקּוּ (Job 21:24); and it is of the heavy conjugation, with dagesh." "And afterward they will drink <b>refined lees</b>, and behold they will become intoxicated, in the sense of כִּי כַּאֲשֶׁר שְׁתִיתֶם עַל הַר קָדְשִׁי (Obadiah 1:16)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:06.967906301Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}